# Messages' gestures on its example conversations: the hold menu, the reply pull with its armed mark and its cancel, the
# times pull, and the back drag's cancel. Read against the same walk on an earlier build. Frames report only.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
launch dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
tap Look around with example conversations
wait 1000
tap Mina Park
wait 800
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
hold the counter!! ok you win
wait 500
expect Reply
shot hold-menu
frames report hold-menu
# Tapping beside the menu closes it, and the chat is there with nothing new in the field.
tap 0.5 0.3
wait 500
absent Copy
expect the counter!! ok you win
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
swipefrom the counter!! ok you win 0.26 0 500
wait 500
expect QUOTED REPLY
shot reply-armed
frames report reply-pull
tap "Don't reply to this"
absent QUOTED REPLY
# A short pull cancels.
swipefrom the counter!! ok you win 0.06 0 450
wait 500
absent QUOTED REPLY
shot reply-short-cancelled
# A left pull shows times while held and returns.
swipefrom the counter!! ok you win -0.22 0 450
wait 500
expect the counter!! ok you win
shot times-returned
# A short drag on blank paper comes back; a long one leaves.
swipe 0.5 0.25 0.59 0.25 500
wait 500
expect Mina Park
expect the counter!! ok you win
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
swipe 0.5 0.25 0.98 0.25 600
wait 800
frames report back-drag
absent the counter!! ok you win
shot back-at-inbox
